# CatDex — Code Review

## Product / UX

- [ ] Capture or onboarding emotional beat not regressed to form-first
- [ ] French copy OK; errors use catalog where applicable
- [ ] Design tokens only — no random hex/spacing

## Architecture

- [ ] UI → store/lib → remote boundaries respected
- [ ] Pending capture lifecycle correct
- [ ] No OpenAI key in app

## Game feel

- [ ] New reward/analysis UI respects reduced motion + haptics prefs
- [ ] Map mystery language preserved for uncaptured cats

## Quality

- [ ] `typecheck` clean for touched packages
- [ ] Server tests updated if normalize/schema changed
- [ ] No leftover debug logs / commented dumps

## Severity guidance

- **Block merge:** security, data loss, broken capture pipeline, token inventing that fragments UI
- **Should fix:** a11y labels on new controls, missing empty/error states
- **Nit:** naming, comment polish
